    <string name="account_setup_authorization_code_help_title">Get an email authorization code</string>
    <string name="account_setup_authorization_code_help_text">An authorization code may also be called an app password or client authorization password.\n\nUsually, sign in to your email provider’s website, open Settings or Account Security, enable IMAP/SMTP access, and generate an authorization code. Copy that code here.\n\nDo not enter a one-time SMS verification code. If your provider doesn’t offer authorization codes and explicitly supports regular password sign-in for email clients, enter the email password.</string>
